# Setesdalsheiene: Setesdal Vesthei-Ryfylkeheiane, the great plateau of
# lakes and bare rock between Setesdal and Ryfylke, from Haukeli south
# towards Sirdal. Its official extent (Miljødirektoratet's protected-area
# register). EPSG:25833 metres, on the 2 km tile grid (1674 tiles).
WEST=22000
SOUTH=6518000
EAST=76000
NORTH=6642000
